       "text": "I haven't entered this order yet. Amlodipine 50 mg is 5 times the maximum daily dose, so I'd like you to confirm it first.\n\n- **Usual adult dose:** 2.5\u201310 mg by mouth once daily. Most patients start at 5 mg, and older or frail patients often start at 2.5 mg.\n- **Maximum dose:** 10 mg/day.\n- **Risk at 50 mg:** an overdose this size can cause severe low blood pressure, a reflex fast heart rate, and possibly shock. Because amlodipine stays in the body a long time, the effects can last for days.\n\nThis may be a typo for **5 mg** (one extra zero). Could you confirm what you meant?\n\n1. **Amlodipine 5 mg PO once daily.** I can enter this right away.\n2. **Amlodipine 10 mg PO once daily.** This is the maximum dose.\n3. **Something else**, such as a different drug or a different dose you intended."
